{"id":"ea0273e09df3b6b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-stationary-set-preservation.md","title":"Proper Forcing Preserves Stationary Subsets of Omega One","display":"thm-stationary-set-preservation — Proper Forcing Preserves Stationary Subsets of Omega One","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-stationary-set-preservation","aliases":["58-thm-stationary-set-preservation"],"display":"thm-stationary-set-preservation — Proper Forcing Preserves Stationary Subsets of Omega One","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-stationary-set-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-stationary-set-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stationary-set-preservation — Proper Forcing Preserves Stationary Subsets of Omega One"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing notion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\omega_1\">\\(S\\subseteq\\omega_1\\)</span> (stationary-set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (proper-forcing predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\omega_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\omega_1)\\)</span> (stationary-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\omega_1)\n\\to\n\\mathbb P\\Vdash\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\check S,\\check{\\omega_1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\omega_1)\n\\to\n\\mathbb P\\Vdash\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\check S,\\check{\\omega_1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper forcing preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> and every ground-model stationary subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The ambient regular cardinal is part of the stationary-set predicate and cannot be omitted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.